  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe three items of #1992 that the issue sweep of 2026-11-24 left open. Each is checked at the harness size 1280 x 720, where the Properties leaf is `[990, 104] - [1264, 682]`.\n\n- **Model page, STEP facet budget `Set`** (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/step_budget_row.rs`): the label \"STEP facet budget (next import)\" takes its own line, and the field and `Set` are on the line under it. On one row, `Set` stood at x 1252-1279, past the leaf edge at 1264.\n- **Setup Tool list `Edit`** (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tool_list_page.rs`): the table keeps its sideways scroll (6c0c62c61) and gets a gutter under the grid (the scroll bar width and its two margins). The floating scroll bar's hover strip covered the last row, so a centre click on `Edit` after a scroll across did not reach the button. This is the limitation in the earlier probe comment of 2026-11-18.\n- **Operation page, `Delete operation`**: it already fits the leaf on `main`. The Operation page layout test now names it, so a change that pushes it out is red.\n- Decision record: `docs/decisions/1992-properties-reach.md`.\n\nThe other three rows of the issue's table were already done on `main` (the sweep comment names the commits).\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `egui_app::tests::page_layout::layout_page_model`: `Set` is a new anchor, in the leaf, under its label. Red before the fix: `\"Set\" [[1252.0 248.5] - [1278.9 266.5]] leaves the Properties leaf [[990.0 104.0] - [1264.0 682.0]] across`.\n- `egui_app::tests::tool_list_page::a_centre_click_on_edit_opens_the_tool_after_a_scroll_across` (new): scrolls the table across with wheel events until `Edit` is in the leaf, then clicks its centre. The Properties subject becomes the tool. Red before the fix (the subject stayed `SetupNode(\"Setup1\", Tools)`).\n- `egui_app::tests::page_layout::layout_page_operation`: `Delete operation` is a new anchor, under Generate (green before and after).\n- Also green: `tool_list_page` (2 more), `setup_post_options::the_tool_list_page_exports_the_setups_tools`, `step_budget` (2).\n\nNo new test binary (#3187): the tests are in the `camcraft-ui` lib. The `#[test]` count of `crates/ui` goes up by one.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nThe Properties pane at 1280 x 720, cropped. The images come from the off-screen renderer (`egui_kittest` with the headless wgpu device). The tool list shot scrolls the table across and puts the pointer on the centre of `Edit`. The images are on the images-only `pr-screenshots` branch of the fork.\n\n| | Before (`main` 773736856) | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Model page, STEP facet budget | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1992/before-model-budget.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1992/after-model-budget.png) |\n| Setup Tool list, pointer on Edit | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1992/before-tool-list-edit-hover.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sn3ro/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/1992/after-tool-list-edit-hover.png) |\n\n## Gates\n\nOn d155897d1 (branched from `upstream/main` 773736856):\n\n- Quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`): 10 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled (3.5 min). It includes `ui suites: lib`.\n- `cargo clippy --no-deps --all-targets -p camcraft-ui -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- Heavy lanes: the diff reaches none.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No check by hand in the GUI window. The tests use real pointer events in the shell at 1280 x 720.\n\nChangelog: The STEP facet budget's Set button and the setup tool list's Edit button are in reach in a narrow Properties pane.\n\nFixes #1992\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
